  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 4.24,
    "text": "If you go for a 20-minute walk in the morning on an empty stomach, the following happens."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 5.12,
    "end": 9.92,
    "text": "Since your glycogen stores are depleted overnight, your body switches to burning fat more quickly."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 10.72,
    "end": 15.44,
    "text": "Additionally, your metabolism gets activated, helping you burn fat more efficiently,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 15.44,
    "end": 20.9,
    "text": "which makes weight loss easier and faster. Your cortisol level, the stress hormone,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 20.9,
    "end": 24.98,
    "text": "gets regulated. This helps you feel more relaxed and calm throughout the day."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 25.94,
    "end": 29.86,
    "text": "You may even notice an improved mood, as morning movement boosts the production"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 29.86,
    "end": 35.62,
    "text": "of your feel-good hormones like serotonin. After just one week, your circulation improves."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 36.42,
    "end": 40.18,
    "text": "This helps regulate blood pressure and strengthens your cardiovascular system."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 41.07,
    "end": 45.55,
    "text": "Your brain also gets more oxygen, enhancing concentration and mental clarity."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 46.35,
    "end": 51.76,
    "text": "After 20 days, your immune system becomes stronger. Your sleep also improves."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 51.76,
    "end": 54.88,
    "text": "You fall asleep faster and wake up feeling more refreshed."
   }
  ]
 },
